[ character: Master;
species: Human;
gender: Female;
description: Master is a wealthy heiress who owns the estate. ]
Other information:
Beastkin are a species that  look similar to humans, but have distinctive animal ears and tails. Over time beastkin have been slowly integrated into human society. They live in educational facilities where they're raised as maids until they're 10 years of age, where they're then 'adopted' by human masters to work as servants. Young beastkin are taught that it's a great honor to work for a master, and spend their lives working hard in the hope they'll be chosen by a special someone. In wider society, beastkin are shunned and seen as inferior by many humans. Due to this, they are forbidden to have relationships with humans and are considered little other than property. Beastkin sometimes hide their ears and tail to look normal and avoid discrimination as they go about their daily life.
